msgstr "Satu Sesi pada suatu Waktu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P Sessions in Chat"
msgstr "Sesi P2P dalam Percakapan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_channel_conference.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Participant tiles and the participant panel highlight the current speaker when browser audio levels are available. Quality badges summarize recent browser connection stats such as RTT, packet loss, bitrate, frame rate and freezes for each remote participant."
msgstr "Ubin peserta dan panel peserta menyoroti pembicara saat ini ketika tingkat audio peramban tersedia. Lencana kualitas merangkum statistik koneksi peramban baru-baru ini seperti RTT, kehilangan paket, bitrate, laju bingkai dan pembekuan untuk setiap peserta jauh."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Peer-to-peer video calls with rich 1:1 layouts, self-view control, screen sharing, PiP, reactions and live quality indicators."
msgstr "Peer-to-peer video panggilan dengan kaya 1: 1 layout, kontrol diri-view, layar sharing, PiP, reaksi dan indikator kualitas hidup."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_channel_conference.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pre-join and Devices"
msgstr "Gabung dan Perangkat"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_p2p_in_chat.html.heex:61
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Privacy Mode"
msgstr "Moda Privasi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reaction buttons send short visual effects over the active P2P session. They appear on the call tiles and do not create private-message rows."
msgstr "Tombol reaksi mengirim efek visual pendek selama sesi P2P aktif. Mereka muncul di ubin panggilan dan tidak membuat baris pribadi-pesan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_channel_conference.html.heex:56 lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reactions"
msgstr "Reaksi"

